% expect-output: 20
% expect-output: 0
% Scenario: stringwidth paints nothing. Measuring a Type 3 glyph runs its
% procedure without recording anything: the page delivered afterwards
% has no operations and no font resource.
% Expect: 20 and 0.
/Sq 7 dict dup begin
  /FontType 3 def
  /FontMatrix [0.001 0 0 0.001 0 0] def
  /Encoding StandardEncoding def
  /FontBBox [0 0 1000 1000] def
  /BuildGlyph { pop pop 1000 0 0 0 1000 1000 setcachedevice 0 0 1000 1000 rectfill } def
end definefont pop
/Sq findfont 20 scalefont setfont
(a) stringwidth round cvi exch round cvi = =
showpage
